    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok but i already checked and the bottle says it's totally safe for daily use. if i just take a tiny bit of a high-potassium drink like a coconut water or something once in a while instead of a pill, would that be any better? i just need something to stop these cramps so i can sleep. is there any way i can just tell the cramps to stop without calling the doctor?",
